#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

BASE="$HOME/.richmackos"
CHANNELS="$BASE/youtube-channels.json"


show_help() {
cat <<'HELP'
RichmackOS YouTube Knowledge Engine

Usage:

  richmack youtube COMMAND [OPTIONS]


CHANNEL MANAGEMENT

  channels
      List configured YouTube channels.

  add-channel KEY "NAME" URL
      Add a YouTube channel.

  remove-channel KEY
      Remove a configured channel.


INGESTION

  sync --limit N
      Sync the newest N videos from every configured channel.

      IMPORTANT:
      After transcript sync completes, RichmackOS automatically runs:

          richmack youtube knowledge build --all

      This means normal sync also updates the structured
      YouTube Knowledge Engine.

  sync --channel KEY --limit N
      Sync only one channel.

      After synchronization, RichmackOS updates the
      structured YouTube Knowledge Engine.

  status
      Show YouTube transcript ingestion status.


KNOWLEDGE BUILDING

  knowledge build CHANNEL
      Build structured knowledge for one channel.

      Example:

          richmack youtube knowledge build tim-ferriss

  knowledge build CHANNEL --limit N
      Build only the newest N indexed videos.

      Example:

          richmack youtube knowledge build \
            tim-ferriss \
            --limit 5

  knowledge build --all
      Build structured knowledge for every configured channel.

      Example:

          richmack youtube knowledge build --all

  knowledge build CHANNEL --force
      Force a rebuild.

  knowledge build CHANNEL --force --no-summary
      Rebuild deterministic knowledge without rerunning
      Gemma summaries.

      Example:

          richmack youtube knowledge build \
            tim-ferriss \
            --limit 5 \
            --force \
            --no-summary


VERIFY KNOWLEDGE

  knowledge status
      Show structured YouTube knowledge status.

      Example:

          richmack youtube knowledge status

  knowledge videos CHANNEL
      List indexed videos for a channel.

      Example:

          richmack youtube knowledge videos tim-ferriss

  knowledge topics CHANNEL
      Show extracted concepts and topics.

      Example:

          richmack youtube knowledge topics tim-ferriss


STRUCTURED KNOWLEDGE FLOW

  YouTube
      ↓
  yt-dlp subtitles
      ↓
  cleaned transcript
      ↓
  ~/Knowledge-Inbox/YouTube/
      ↓
  RichmackRAG
      ↓
  YouTube Knowledge Engine
      ↓
  metadata / transcript / chunks / topics / resources
      ↓
  transcript-first evidence chat


SEARCH / RAG

  search QUERY
      Search downloaded transcript text.

  ask CHANNEL "QUESTION"
      Ask a scoped RAG question.

  ask CHANNEL --latest "QUESTION"
      Restrict the question to the newest transcript.


SUMMARIES

  summarize CHANNEL --limit N
      Summarize recent videos from one channel.

  summarize --all --limit N
      Summarize every configured channel.

  summarize --all --limit N --combined
      Generate channel summaries plus one combined briefing.


EVIDENCE CHAT

  chat CHANNEL
      Open transcript-first interactive evidence chat.

      Example:

          richmack youtube chat tim-ferriss


CHAT FEATURES

  Channel isolation
  Video routing
  Transcript-first retrieval
  Evidence citations
  Follow-up video memory
  Per-video channel analysis
  Cross-video synthesis
  Claim attribution


INSIDE YOUTUBE CHAT

  /help
      Show interactive help.

  /video
      Show the current selected video.

  /sources
      Show evidence used for the previous answer.

  /clear
      Clear video/follow-up context.

  /quit
      Exit chat.


NORMAL WORKFLOW

  1. Sync recent videos:

      richmack youtube sync --limit 3

     This automatically updates structured knowledge.

  2. Optional manual rebuild:

      richmack youtube knowledge build --all

  3. Verify knowledge:

      richmack youtube knowledge status

  4. Inspect videos:

      richmack youtube knowledge videos tim-ferriss

  5. Inspect topics:

      richmack youtube knowledge topics tim-ferriss

  6. Open evidence chat:

      richmack youtube chat tim-ferriss

  7. Ask:

      what is the 4x4 protocol?

  8. Inspect sources:

      /sources

  9. Generate a combined briefing:

      richmack youtube summarize --all --limit 3 --combined


DANNY JONES EXAMPLE

  richmack youtube knowledge build \
    danny-jones \
    --limit 5

  richmack youtube knowledge topics danny-jones

  richmack youtube chat danny-jones

  youtube> what are the main topics across the latest videos?

  youtube> what is the most unusual claim discussed?

  youtube> what else did they say about it?


TIM FERRISS EXAMPLE

  richmack youtube knowledge build \
    tim-ferriss \
    --limit 5

  richmack youtube knowledge videos tim-ferriss

  richmack youtube chat tim-ferriss

  youtube> what is the 4x4 protocol?

  youtube> what else is mentioned?

  youtube> /sources


DISCOVERY

  workflow
      Show the recommended end-to-end workflow.

  examples
      Show example commands and example chat questions.


MORE HELP

  richmack youtube workflow

  richmack youtube examples

  richmack youtube chat --help

  man richmack
HELP
}


